<title>ITALY: Alitalia lifts domestic fares by 3pct.</title>
<headline>Alitalia lifts domestic fares by 3pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian national carrier Alitalia said on Sunday it was lifting prices for its full economy domestic air fares by three percent because of a recent hike in fuel costs.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the price increase would come into force on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
